PROPOSAL ONLY - not in force. Short terms to pin in the Discord and/or add as CONTRIBUTING.md.

Suggestions and contributions - simple terms
1. This is a free, non-commercial fan project, not affiliated with Project Moon.
2. If you post an idea, bug report or custom kit here, you allow the maintainer(s) to use, adapt and include it in the app and its data without payment or credit obligation (credit given if you ask and we can). You keep the rights to your own work.
3. Only post things you made or may share. No leaks, datamined unreleased content, ripped game art/audio, or other people's private information.
4. Code contributions: by submitting a pull request you agree it is licensed under the repository's license (once chosen), and that you have the right to submit it.
5. Be kind. No harassment, hate, NSFW or spam. Moderators may remove content and members. Report problems to a moderator.
6. Discord requires members to be 13+ (or the higher minimum age in their country); do not collect or ask for personal data.
7. Rights holders: message a moderator to request changes or removal; we will act promptly.
